{"strongs": "H7596", "word": "שְׁאֵלָה", "translit": "she.e.lah", "root": "שרר", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "request, thing asked for", "definition": "שְׁאֵלָה [I. שֵׁלָה ] noun feminine request, thing asked for : — ׳ שְׁא Judg 8:24 , +; suffix שְׁאֵלָתִּי 1Sam 1:27 +, שֶׁאֱלָתּי Job 6:8 , שְׁאֵלָתֵךְ Esth 5:6 +, שֵׁלָתֵךְ 1Sam 1:17 , שֶׁאֱלָתָם Ps 106:15 — 1. request, petition , Judg 8:24 ; 1Kgs 2:16 ; 1Kgs 2:20 (both accusative of congnate meaning with verb with שָׁאַל ), Esth 5:6 ; Esth 5:7 (with נָתַן = grant ), Esth 7:2 ; Esth 7:3 ; Esth 9:12 . This passes easily into 2. thing asked for , 1Sam 2:20 , with נָתַן Esth 5:8 ; Ps 106:15 ׳ תָּבוֺא שׁ Job 6:8 . — II. שֵׁלָה see below אֶשָׁתָּאֹל proper name, masculine, see above.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8372')\">BDB8372</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7596')\">H7596</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7956')\">H7956</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8371')\">BDB8371</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8373')\">BDB8373</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁאֵלָה</bdbheb> [I. <bdbheb>שֵׁלָה</bdbheb>] <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>request, thing asked for</highlightword>: — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:24\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,24)\">Judg 8:24</ref>, +; suffix <bdbheb>שְׁאֵלָתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,27)\">1Sam 1:27</ref> +, <bdbheb>שֶׁאֱלָתּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 6:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,8)\">Job 6:8</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁאֵלָתֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 5:6\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,6)\">Esth 5:6</ref> +, <bdbheb>שֵׁלָתֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,17)\">1Sam 1:17</ref>, <bdbheb>שֶׁאֱלָתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 106:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,15)\">Ps 106:15</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>request, petition</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 8:24\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,24)\">Judg 8:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,16)\">1Kgs 2:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,20)\">1Kgs 2:20</ref> (both accusative of congnate meaning with verb with <bdbheb>שָׁאַל</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Esth 5:6\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,6)\">Esth 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 5:7\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,7)\">Esth 5:7</ref> (with <bdbheb>נָתַן</bdbheb> = <highlight>grant</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Esth 7:2\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,2)\">Esth 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:3\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,3)\">Esth 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,12)\">Esth 9:12</ref>. This passes easily into </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>thing asked for</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,20)\">1Sam 2:20</ref>, with <bdbheb>נָתַן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 5:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,8)\">Esth 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 106:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,15)\">Ps 106:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תָּבוֺא שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 6:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,8)\">Job 6:8</ref>.